Agents-Core replaces FastEmbed's package with direct ONNX Runtime, Hugging Face
Tokenizers and Hub calls. The text adapter, download handling and regression
tests are maintained here. Original model names, sources, files, dimensions and
model-specific numerical conventions are retained. Models remain subject to
the licenses recorded in their catalog entries; no model weights are bundled.
